{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player start"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 1, "text": "Мен қайдамын?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 2, "text": "Таныс жер."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 3, "text": "Мен осы ойдамын ба?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 4, "text": "// Player try open the door"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 5, "text": "Жабық?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 6, "text": "// Player in dark"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 7, "text": "Мұнда өте қараңғы."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location2", "line_index": 8, "text": "Мен ешнәрсе көрмеймін."}
